{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53475","headline":"太常寺观舞圣寿乐 · 徐元弼","name":"太常寺观舞圣寿乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舞字传新庆，人文迈旧章。\n冲融和气洽，悠远圣功长。\n盛德流无外，时时乐未央。\n日华增顾眄，风物助低昂。\n翥凤方齐首，高鸿忽继行。\n云门与兹曲，同是奉陶唐。\n（《文苑英华》卷一八四）（按：《全唐诗》卷七八一误以作者爲徐元鼎，无事迹，今改正重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐元弼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}